<title>UK: Sumitomo Bank unit sets 110 mln Sfr warrants.</title>
<headline>Sumitomo Bank unit sets 110 mln Sfr warrants.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following equity-linked issue was announced by joint lead managers Banca del Gottardo, Daiwa Securities Bank (Switzerland) and Sumitomo Bank (Schweiz).</p>
<p> BORROWER   NEXT COAL LTD</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  THE SUMITOMO BANK LTD</p>
<p> AMT 110.35 MLN SFR   COUPON     0.125     MATURITY    20.SEP.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 **	  ISS PRICE  100.5     PAY DATE    20.SEP.96</p>
<p> PAY FREQ   ANNUAL    FULL FEES  =</p>
<p> NOTES   ** NOTES WITH WARRANTS TO PURCHASE FULLY PAID AND</p>
<p>		NON-ASSESSABLE SHARES OF COMMON STOCK OF</p>
<p>		SUMITOMO COAL MINING</p>
<p>		EXERCISE PERIOD   - 04.OCT.96-06.SEP.99</p>
<p>		50 WARRANTS PER NOTE</p>
<p>		FOREX RATE 90.62 YEN PER SWISS FRANC</p>
<p>		EXERCISE PRICE TO BE FIXED ON SEPTEMBER 3</p>
<p>-- LONDON NEWSROOM +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
